    "detailed_description": "Overview:<br />\r\n- Explore the ocean in Virtual Reality! Many beautiful and exotic sea creatures await.<br />\r\n- This is an easy to play, relaxing, game / experience where you are ZOSU the explorer and you are collecting sea creatures to save them from extinction to score points in a series of beautiful levels with a large variety of creatures.<br />\r\n- 30 ocean levels to explore, more of a relaxing experience than a game.<br />\r\n- Over 100 sea animals to save, the majority are randomly spawned.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n- Built-in right hand jetpack for movement. Jetpack body movement is set to the direction of your right hand.<br />\r\n- Walking and jumping movement is set to the direction you are looking.<br />\r\n- Score points by collecting fish and finding randomly spawned treasure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n- Timed scoring and freeplay modes.<br />\r\n- Sea creatures include starfish, turtles, dolphins, sharks, whales, squid, dinosaurs, many common and exotic fish, and large sea mammals.",
